# The turret walk: the documented human line against Impossible, as a
# doctrine.
#
# The punch died three ways at once (log 2026-07-31): a 25-unit fist dents
# 3-5k of a 3.7x economy and evaporates. The creep spends the same credits
# on ground that does not evaporate: turrets walked at the enemy, each
# covering the next builder's walk, claimed before production so the line
# funds first ([[policy-creep]]). The army exists to intercept raiders and
# escort the frontier, not to win the match -- the line wins the match.

name creeper
goals extractorT1,extractorT1,extractorT1,c_tank,c_tank,hoverTank,c_artillery
heavies none
max_workers 6
mass 25
reserve -1
expand 1
counter 1
cover 0
intercept 1
guard_cap 0
aa_cover 0
forward 0
scout 0
raid 0
rush 0
creep 1
riposte 0
tech 0
